sequenceDiagram
  actor Citizen
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant DB
  participant Triage
  participant LLM

  Citizen->>Client: Describe concern in plain language
  Client->>API: POST /api/v1/intakes
  API->>API: Zod validate body
  API->>DB: Insert LegalIntake aiStatus PENDING
  Note right of DB: originalDescription is written once and never overwritten
  API->>Triage: Classify and summarise
  Triage->>LLM: Prompt with allowed category list
  alt Provider returns valid JSON in the category list
    LLM-->>Triage: Category, summary, urgency, keywords, confidence
    Triage->>Triage: Zod schema and whitelist check
    API->>DB: Update aiStatus COMPLETED
  else Timeout, invalid JSON, or provider error
    LLM-->>Triage: Failure
    API->>DB: Update aiStatus FAILED_FALLBACK needsHumanReview true
    Note right of DB: Summary is an excerpt of the user's own text
  end
  API-->>Client: HTTP 201 intake either way
  Client-->>Citizen: Organised result or fallback, not legal advice
  Citizen->>Client: Request recommendations
  Client->>API: GET /intakes/:id/recommendations
  API->>DB: Eligible lawyers, deterministic rank
  API-->>Client: Lawyers with human-readable reasons
